/*--------------------------------------------

TEST: dispersion through a base-down prism, lit by white light.

The source is a beam from infinity written with the new  "white": true  shorthand - it stands for
a LINKED group of beams, one per wavelength of the white-light group (red, green and blue unless the
Wavelengths dialog says otherwise), which move as one. Written out in full the same thing is three
sources sharing a "group" number, each with its own "wavelength" (nm).

The prism is a thin 45 prism dioptre prism of dense flint (SF11, Abbe number about 26). A thin prism
deviates light by (n - 1) times its angle, so each colour leaves at a slightly different angle: the
beams overlap (and add up to white, with Additive beams on) until they have separated.

"settings" lists what this file needs switched on to make its point: advanced materials (so the index
depends on wavelength), the dark diagram and additive beams (so red + green + blue shows as white).
Change the material of the prism to "Custom" (no material) and the colours stay together.

Click a beam (or drag it) and the Ref. Index column, the Summary and the pupils follow that colour.

----------------------------------------------*/

{

	"viewBox" : [ -0.1, 0.35, 0.9, 0.45 ],

	"settings" : { "advancedMaterials": true, "darkCanvas": true, "additiveBeams": true },

	"sources" : [ { "id" 		: 1,
					"type" 		: "object",
					"which"		: "object",
					"infinity"	: true,
					"white"		: true,
					"beamwidth" : 0.008,
					"z"			: NaN,
					"h"			: NaN,
					"t"			: 0 } ],

	"title": "TEST Dispersion: 45 Base-Down Prism (SF11), white light",
	"prescription": [{
		"id": "0001",
		"type": "index",
		"description": "air",
		"args": {
			"index": 1.000
		}
	}, {
		"id": "0002",
		"type": "prism",
		"description": "45 base-down prism",
		"args": {
			"stop": true,
			"power": 45,
			"base": "down",
			"material": "SF11 dense flint",
			"height": 0.1,
			"aperture": 0.08
		}
	}, {
		"id": "0003",
		"type": "index",
		"description": "air",
		"args": {
			"index": 1.000,
			"thickness": 0.7
		}
	}]
}
